     "body": "<p>noting options that <b>don't</b> work:</p>\n\n<p>maven-resources-plugin resource filtering doesn't seem to resolve dependency names ( also see <a href=\"http://jira.codehaus.org/browse/MRESOURCES-118\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://jira.codehaus.org/browse/MRESOURCES-118</a> )</p>\n\n<p>maven-replacer-plugin (com.google.code.maven-replacer-plugin) doesn't seem to have a way to resolve dependency names (e.g. $</p>\n{org.fcrepo:foo}\n<p>)</p>\n\n<p>maven-antrun-plugin seems the closest: $</p>\n{asm:asm:jar}\n<p> or $</p>\n{maven.dependency.asm.asm.jar}\n<p> gives an absolute path to the dependency, but we only want the filename</p>",
     "created": "15/Jun/12 5:37 AM",
