  "description": "<p>fcrepo-server/src/main/resources/properties/resources/install.properties contains entries such as</p>\n\n<p>install.jdbc.mysql              = mysql-connector-java-5.1.20.jar<br/>\ninstall.jdbc.derby              = derby-10.8.2.2.jar</p>\n\n<p>Rather than hardcoding the dependency filenames, they should be tokens (e.g. $mysql) that are replaced with the actual value during the Maven build.</p>\n\n<p>This would prevent install.properties getting out of sync every time the dependencies are updated.</p>",
